[I] 'D is not GLib' utility libraries

[T] ding-libs ('D is not GLib') is a set of small C utility libraries
[T] originally developed for SSSD. It includes libpath_utils, libdhash
[T] (dynamic hash tables), libcollection, libref_array and libini_config for
[T] parsing INI style configuration files.

[U] https://pagure.io/SSSD/ding-libs/

[A] Ding-libs Authors
